{"about_the_game":"Fastraq is a sci-fi based high-speed anti-gravity racing game. Drive on roller coaster like tracks, overtake your opponents and engage in combat. Experience tight turns, 360 degree loops and intense combat.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Hyper-sonic mode</h2>In hyper-sonic mode you race against 14 AI opponents at speeds of 2000 mph on roller coaster like loopy and curvy tracks.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Hyper-combat mode</h2>In hyper-combat mode, you engage in intense machine to machine combat at speeds of 2000 mph with 14 AI opponents. You can use variety of weapons like plasma weapon or bullets to destroy your opponent.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Campaign</h2>Dive straight into the campaign mode. Campaign consists of 20 unique levels. Each level is more difficult than the previous one. And you need to win a level to unlock the next one.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Vehicles</h2>There are six different vehicles to choose from. Depending on the track you want to race, choose your vehicle and strategize your race to win it.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Works well with a controller<br></li><li>Intense combat racing<br></li><li>Competitive AI<br></li><li>Roller coaster like tracks<br></li><li>5 game modes<br></li><li>5 levels of difficulty</li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2178650?t=1760995043","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2178650/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1760995043","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2178650/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1760995043","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2178650/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1760995043","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"Fastraq is a sci-fi based high-speed anti-gravity racing game. Drive on roller coaster like tracks, overtake your opponents and engage in combat. Experience tight turns, 360 degree loops and intense combat.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Hyper-sonic mode</h2>In hyper-sonic mode you race against 14 AI opponents at speeds of 2000 mph on roller coaster like loopy and curvy tracks.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Hyper-combat mode</h2>In hyper-combat mode, you engage in intense machine to machine combat at speeds of 2000 mph with 14 AI opponents. You can use variety of weapons like plasma weapon or bullets to destroy your opponent.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Campaign</h2>Dive straight into the campaign mode. Campaign consists of 20 unique levels. Each level is more difficult than the previous one. And you need to win a level to unlock the next one.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Vehicles</h2>There are six different vehicles to choose from. Depending on the track you want to race, choose your vehicle and strategize your race to win it.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Works well with a controller<br></li><li>Intense combat racing<br></li><li>Competitive AI<br></li><li>Roller coaster like tracks<br></li><li>5 game modes<br></li><li>5 levels of difficulty</li></ul>","developers":["Rahul Khanna"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Racing","id":"9"},{"description":"Sports","id":"18"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2178650/header.jpg?t=1760995043","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Ubuntu<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5 4th Gen or equivalent<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GeForce GTX 970 4 GB<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 4 GB available space</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>